[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16980.03, "timestamp": "04:43:00", "text": "我这次尽量不把你炸飞了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16989.15, "timestamp": "04:43:09", "text": "是的，我接下来要说话了，你好，圣，哦，等等，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16992.91, "timestamp": "04:43:12", "text": "是的，你好，你看到了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17004.39, "timestamp": "04:43:24", "text": "不，我的胸罩就像是“是的，圣”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17007.99, "timestamp": "04:43:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17014.11, "timestamp": "04:43:34", "text": "好的，你起来的时候告诉我一声。"}]